Pebble's directory: https://localhost:59013/dir (always-valid off: it validates for real)

## BareProxy
global
  admin WORK/admin.sock
  state WORK/state
  trace-log WORK/trace.log
  acme-ca https://localhost:59013/dir
  acme-email ops@auto.test

site auto.test:34611
  route /* -> respond 200 "hello over ACME"

$ WORK/bareproxy explain --config WORK/bareproxy.conf GET https://auto.test:34611/
Running config WORK/bareproxy.conf, version 1
Site auto.test (line 8): exact host match
Certificate: automatic, from https://localhost:59013/dir, kept in WORK/state/certs
  line 9    route /* -> respond 200 "hello over ACME"   match
Path: /
Action: BareProxy answers 200 itself with "hello over ACME"

